      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AMORE VELOCE (5) is resuming from a break of three-and-a-half months for a new stable after finishing 12th over 1200m at Eagle Farm at her latest outing. Goes well when fresh with two wins and two minor placings from seven starts. This is easier and shapes as one of the main contenders. GREAT COSMIC (7) scored by 9 lengths last start at Julia Creek over 1200m. Has a strong record at this trip, scoring two times from four starts. Best form puts him right in this. HEAVENLY LEGEND (1) built on a nice second two starts back at Barcaldine with a win over 1200m at Blackall two-and-a-half weeks ago, getting home by a nose. Well placed and there is no reason why he cannot score again. VIKING VALOUR (2) showed good speed to stalk the pace before drawing clear to score by a long neck over 1200m here last time out. Yet to miss the placings at this circuit, including four wins. Among the top-three hopes.",
